<p dir="auto">Added the form element to allow the user to hit enter to submit a list item, thus preventDefault() is also necessary.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">This change makes the Shopping List Example more efficient and more realistic to what you would see in real world forms. It betters the project because we are using focus() to return back to the input, but the user now needs to move their mouse to click submit each time. Now the user doesn't leave the keyboard.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event/preventDefault" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">preventDefault()</code></a></p>
